// Part kinds, tool schemas and the progression curve. Edit here, not in Rust.
// A schema lists its parts in assembly order with stat weights; `mining_level: true`
// marks parts whose material level counts, `handle: true` parts whose handle modifier
// multiplies durability. Each level adds one modifier slot to `modifier_slots`.
